# The forced Duffing oscillator
# A mass in a double well, damped and shaken. For this forcing it hops
# between the two wells chaotically (Duffing, 1918).
x'=y
y'=x-x^3-delta*y+gamma*cos(omega*t)
par delta=0.3,gamma=0.5,omega=1.2
init x=1,y=0
@ total=400,dt=0.01,meth=rungekutta,maxstor=200000
@ xp=x,yp=y,xlo=-2,xhi=2,ylo=-1.5,yhi=1.5
done
